  "body": [
    "Coffee, tea, and cold-pressed juice — each sourced carefully, made in small batches, and built for a particular kind of morning. Start with what you're pouring today.",
    "House blends built for consistency, traceable single origins for the days you want to taste a place, and premium instant for when you're in a hurry. Ground, whole bean, or pods.",
    "Eight blends across black, green and herbal, plus a small reserve of rare leaf. Loose or in bags, in three sizes — chosen for the slow afternoon hour.",
    "Cold-pressed singles and blends, plus concentrates to mix your own. No added sugar, nothing from concentrate — just fruit and veg, pressed slow and kept cold.",
    "Sit at the bar and work through coffee, tea and juice with our team. It's the fastest way to find your everyday cup.",
    "Warm mornings, made effortless. Coffee, tea, and cold-pressed juice, and the machines that make them sing.",
    "© 2026 Fréscopa · Privacy · Terms · A fictional brand, created for demonstration."
  ],
